"""
    pw_client_events

Client events

| Field       | Note                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| :---------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| info        | Notify client info  # Arguments * `info`: info about the client                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| permissions | Notify a client permission  Event emitted as a result of the get\\_permissions method.  # Arguments * `default_permissions`: the default permissions * `index`: the index of the first permission entry * `n_permissions`: the number of permissions * `permissions`: the permissions |
"""
struct pw_client_events
    version::UInt32
    info::Ptr{Cvoid}
    permissions::Ptr{Cvoid}
end

"""
    pw_client_methods

Client methods

| Field                | Note                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| :------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| error                | Send an error to a client  This requires W and X permissions on the client.  # Arguments * `id`: the global id to report the error on * `res`: an errno style error code * `message`: an error string                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| update\\_properties  | Update client properties  This requires W and X permissions on the client.  # Arguments * `props`: new properties                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| get\\_permissions    | Get client permissions  A permissions event will be emitted with the permissions.  This requires W and X permissions on the client.  # Arguments * `index`: the first index to query, 0 for first * `num`: the maximum number of items to get                                                                                                                                                  |
| update\\_permissions | Manage the permissions of the global objects for this client  Update the permissions of the global objects using the provided array with permissions  Globals can use the default permissions or can have specific permissions assigned to them.  This requires W and X permissions on the client.  # Arguments * `n_permissions`: number of permissions * `permissions`: array of permissions |
"""
struct pw_client_methods
    version::UInt32
    add_listener::Ptr{Cvoid}
    error::Ptr{Cvoid}
    update_properties::Ptr{Cvoid}
    get_permissions::Ptr{Cvoid}
    update_permissions::Ptr{Cvoid}
end

